{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b6e1a2d4-2f3a-4c1e-9a2f-7c1e2d3f4a5b",
    "name": "E-Commerce API - Grupo 6 Jueves Noche",
    "description": "Coleccion completa de la API. Correr las carpetas en orden (1 a 6): los logins guardan los tokens en variables de coleccion y cada carpeta usa los ids que dejo la anterior. Se puede correr las veces que haga falta: no deja nada sucio en la base.\n\nDatos que ya existen al levantar la app:\n- ADMIN: admin@uade.com / admin123 (lo crea AdminInicialConfig)\n- Categorias del catalogo: Calzado, Ropa y Accesorios (las crea CategoriaInicialConfig)\n\nDatos que crea la coleccion:\n- CLIENTE: cliente@uade.com / cliente123 (carpeta 1)\n- Producto, variante, carrito y pedido de prueba (carpetas 2 y 4)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenAdmin", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenCliente", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenCliente2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoriaId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoriaPruebaId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productoId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "varianteId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "carritoItemId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pedidoId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Auth",
      "description": "Registro y login. Los dos logins guardan el token en una variable de coleccion; el resto de las carpetas lo usan en el header Authorization.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar Cliente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// 201 la primera vez; 400 'El email ya se encuentra registrado' si se vuelve a correr.",
                  "pm.test('Registro exitoso o usuario ya existente', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([201, 400]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.test('El registro siempre crea un CLIENTE, nunca un ADMIN', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(pm.response.json().rol).to.eql('CLIENTE');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Lisandro\",\n  \"apellido\": \"Duclos\",\n  \"email\": \"cliente@uade.com\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"cliente123\",\n  \"telefono\": \"1122334455\",\n  \"fechaNacimiento\": \"2000-05-10\",\n  \"genero\": \"MASCULINO\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/registro",
            "description": "Alta publica de usuario. AuthService fuerza el rol CLIENTE: no se puede auto-registrar un ADMIN."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Cliente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenCliente', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@uade.com\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"cliente123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "Devuelve el JWT firmado con jwt.secret y valido por jwt.expiration-ms (24 h)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', pm.response.json().token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@uade.com\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 - Admin (ABM del catalogo)",
      "description": "Todo lo que solo puede hacer el ADMIN. Requiere haber corrido Login Admin.\n\nEl ABM de categorias se hace sobre una categoria descartable que se crea y se borra aca mismo: Calzado, Ropa y Accesorios son datos del negocio y no se tocan.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener Categorias del Catalogo",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Calzado, Ropa y Accesorios vienen sembradas por CategoriaInicialConfig.",
                  "// Se guarda el id de Ropa para colgar de ahi el producto de prueba.",
                  "pm.test('Estan las tres categorias del catalogo', function () {",
                  "    var nombres = pm.response.json().map(function (c) { return c.nombre; });",
                  "    pm.expect(nombres).to.include.members(['Calzado', 'Ropa', 'Accesorios']);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var ropa = pm.response.json().find(function (c) { return c.nombre === 'Ropa'; });",
                  "if (ropa) { pm.collectionVariables.set('categoriaId', ropa.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" } ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear Categoria",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('categoriaPruebaId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Categoria de prueba\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Se crea y se elimina en esta misma carpeta\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar Categoria",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Categoria de prueba\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Descripcion modificada por el PUT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias/{{categoriaPruebaId}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear Producto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('productoId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Remera basica\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"100% algodon\",\n  \"precio\": 9999.5,\n  \"marca\": \"UADE Wear\",\n  \"categoriaId\": {{categoriaId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productos"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Agregar Variante",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('varianteId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"talle\": \"M\",\n  \"color\": \"Negro\",\n  \"stock\": 15\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productos/{{productoId}}/variantes"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar Stock de Variante",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"stock\": 20\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productos/{{productoId}}/variantes/{{varianteId}}/stock"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" } ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar Categoria de prueba",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Cierra el CRUD de categorias y deja la base como estaba, para que la",
                  "// coleccion se pueda volver a correr sin chocar con el nombre duplicado.",
                  "pm.test('Status 204', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(204); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}" } ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias/{{categoriaPruebaId}}"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 - Catalogo publico (sin token)",
      "description": "Ninguno de estos requests manda Authorization: un visitante sin login puede navegar el catalogo completo, pero no comprar.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar Categorias",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/categorias" },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Productos",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/productos" },
          "response": []
